[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":136},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":-5,"_45":46,"_47":48,"_49":50,"_51":52,"_53":37,"_54":37,"_55":-5,"_56":37,"_57":58},"expiresAt",1794195831000,"id","nuymmb6dnd20wlrfxamgfgjgq","title","Cisco 披露 Node.js 与 Brotli 漏洞影响通告，涉及 CVE-2026-111497 等4项","originalTitle","Vulnerabilities in Node.js and Brotli Affecting Cisco Products: October 2026","summary","Cisco 披露 Node.js 与 Brotli 中4个安全影响等级为 High 的漏洞：CVE-2026-111497 为 Brotli 解码器越界写，存在潜在 RCE，CVE-2026-105482 涉及 DNS 解析截断，CVE-2026-105483 和 CVE-2026-106069 为 TLS 主机名验证绕过。","reason","通告列明4个高危漏洞、受影响产品调查状态和修复版本，并明确已有PoC但未见针对Cisco产品的恶意利用。","source",{"_65":135},"links",{"_122":134},"publishedAt","2026-11-04T10:52:10.000Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-04T19:44:22.828Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133],"score",73,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","body",{"_58":121,"_122":-5,"_123":124,"_125":37},"outline",[72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[59,60,61,62],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_63":70,"_65":71},{"_63":68,"_65":69},{"_63":31,"_65":67},{"_63":64,"_65":66},"slug","research","name","技术研究","漏洞披露","supply-chain","供应链安全","cisco","Cisco / 思科",{"_11":119,"_88":120,"_90":91},{"_11":117,"_88":118,"_90":91},{"_11":115,"_88":116,"_90":91},{"_11":113,"_88":114,"_90":91},{"_11":111,"_88":112,"_90":91},{"_11":109,"_88":110,"_90":91},{"_11":107,"_88":108,"_90":91},{"_11":105,"_88":106,"_90":91},{"_11":103,"_88":104,"_90":91},{"_11":101,"_88":102,"_90":91},{"_11":99,"_88":100,"_90":91},{"_11":97,"_88":98,"_90":91},{"_11":95,"_88":96,"_90":94},{"_11":92,"_88":93,"_90":94},{"_11":87,"_88":89,"_90":91},"sec-15","text","反馈","level",2,"sec-14","法律免责声明详情",3,"sec-13","软件下载和技术支持","sec-12","法律免责声明","sec-11","修订历史","sec-10","URL","sec-9","本公告的操作链接","sec-8","Cisco 安全漏洞政策","sec-7","来源","sec-6","利用情况与公开公告","sec-5","固定软件","sec-4","临时缓解措施","sec-3","受影响产品","sec-2","摘要","sec-1","影响 Cisco 产品的 Node.js 和 Brotli 漏洞：2026 年 10 月","<table>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tbody><tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 id=\"sec-1\">影响 Cisco 产品的 Node.js 和 Brotli 漏洞：2026 年 10 月</h2>\n\n<p>高</p>\n\n\n<p><a>\n          电子邮件\n        </a>\n</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"sec-2\">\n<p>\n                        摘要\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>2026 年 10 月 21 日，Node.js 宣布为以下受支持发布版本系列中的多个漏洞提供修复：22.x、24.x 和 26.x。</p>\n<p>这些漏洞会影响 Brotli 解码器、DNS 解析和 TLS 证书验证等关键操作。这些漏洞可能带来远程代码执行和流量拦截风险。有关更多信息，请参阅 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/october-2026-security-releases\">Node.js 安全发布</a>。</p>\n<p>以下漏洞的安全影响评级 (SIR) 为高，本公告对这些漏洞进行了处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CVE-2026-111497 - Brotli 解码器越界写入；可能导致远程代码执行</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-105482 - 涉及嵌入 NUL 字符的 DNS 解析截断</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-105483 - 使用全角 IP 数字绕过 TLS 主机名验证</li>\n<li>CVE-2026-106069 - 使用非规范 IP 地址绕过 TLS 主机名验证</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有关 Splunk 产品和服务的更多信息，请参阅 <a href=\"https://advisory.splunk.com/advisories/SVD-2026-1015\">Splunk 产品中的 Node.js 漏洞 (CVE-2026-111497, CVE-2026-105482, CVE-2026-105483, CVE-2026-106069) - 2026 年 10 月</a></p>\n<p>本次调查于 2026 年 10 月 30 日扩展至 Node.js 之外的 Brotli。Brotli 解码器缺陷 (CVE-2026-111497) 位于 Google Brotli C 解码器中，通常会与其他软件捆绑或链接，因此 Node.js 之外的产品也可能受影响。有关可能受影响的软件，请参阅 <a title=\"https://broccoli2shell.com/\" href=\"https://broccoli2shell.com/\">Broccoli2Shell</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>如果某产品未在本公告中列出，则 Cisco 的审查表明该产品不受此漏洞影响。</p>\n<p>随着更多信息的获得，本公告将进行更新。</p>\n<p>本公告可通过以下链接获取：<br><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u\">https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-3\">\n<p>\n                          受影响产品\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Cisco 正在调查其产品线，以确定哪些产品可能受这些漏洞影响。随着调查推进，Cisco 将通过本公告更新受影响产品的信息。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1#vp\">受影响产品</a>部分将列出每个受影响产品的 Cisco 缺陷 ID。可通过 <a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/BUGID\">Cisco 缺陷搜索工具</a>访问这些缺陷，其中包含其他特定于平台的信息，包括变通方法（如果有）和已修复的软件版本。</p>\n\n<p>下表列出了 Cisco 优先产品，以及针对本公告所述漏洞影响的调查状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco 产品</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN 软件</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Identity Services Engine (ISE)</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOS 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOS XE 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IOS XR 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NX-OS 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Management Center (FMC) 软件</td>\n<td>正在调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Threat Defense (FTD)</td>\n<td>不受影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>如果某产品未在本公告中列出，则 Cisco 的审查表明该产品不受此漏洞影响。</p>\n\n<p>以下产品也在积极调查之中，以确定其是否受本公告所述漏洞影响。</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>应用可观测性</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AppDynamics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AppDynamics Enterprise Console</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AppDynamics Virtual Appliance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cable Devices</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intelligent Node Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>协作与社交媒体</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用于协作的 AI POD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>网络与内容安全设备</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cryptographic Services PureCA (Private PKI CA)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hypershield</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Firewall Adaptive Security Virtual Appliance (ASAv)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure IPS（原 Cisco Next-Generation Intrusion Prevention System (NGIPS)）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>网络管理与配置</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGP Traffic Engineering Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crosswork Hierarchical Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crosswork Workflow Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elastic Services Controller (ESC)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optical Network Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Optical Network Planner</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider Connectivity Assurance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>路由与交换 - 企业和服务提供商</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASR 5000 Series Software (StarOS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud Native Deployment Platform (CNDP)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Enterprise NFV Infrastructure Software (NFVIS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NextFusion Platform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Policy Suite (CPS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ultra Packet Core - Redundancy Configuration Manager (RCM)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>统一计算</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HyperFlex HX Data Platform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>视频、流媒体、TelePresence 与转码设备</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Desk Camera</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>语音与统一通信设备</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud Connect</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>无线</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connected Mobile Experiences (CMX)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Industrial Wireless Monitor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco Cloud Hosted Services</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloud Native Application Observability</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudlock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IoT Operations Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LMA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Robust Intelligence RIME</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Workload SaaS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security Cloud Sign On</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smartlook</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ThousandEyes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vidcast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏洞管理（原 Kenna.VM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex AI Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Assistant for Meetings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Collaboration Control Hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Contact Center</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Integrations and Bots</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Interact</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco Services</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Business Critical Insights</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CX Cloud</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IQ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Managed Services Platform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>云就绪性评估工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>如果某产品未在本公告中列出，则 Cisco 的审查表明该产品不受此漏洞影响。</p>\n<p>有关这些漏洞对 Cisco 优先产品影响的调查状态，请参阅 <a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1#priority\">Cisco 优先产品状态</a> 部分。</p>\n<p>Cisco 正在调查其产品线，以确定哪些产品可能受这些漏洞影响以及每个受影响产品所受到的影响。随着信息的获取，本部分将持续更新。</p>\n<p><strong>已有软件修复的受影响产品</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Cisco 产品</th>\n<th>Cisco Bug ID</th>\n<th>可用修复版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Cable Devices</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Smart PHY</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx49006\">CSCwx49006</a></td>\n<td>版本号待定（2027 年 3 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Endpoint Clients and Software</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Packet Tracer</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>9.2.0（2026 年 12 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Network and Content Security Devices </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duo Network Gateway</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>3.4.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duo Authentication Proxy Local Manager for Windows</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>6.8.1（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Workload</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>版本号待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Network Management and Provisioning </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Business Process Automation (BPA)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx48997\">CSCwx48997</a></td>\n<td>4.1.2（待定）<br>5.0（2026 年 11 月）<br>5.1（待定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst Center（原 DNA Center）</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx48988\">CSCwx48988</a></td>\n<td>3.4.1（2027 年 7 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multi-Site Orchestrator</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>2027.1.0（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Endpoint - Private Cloud Appliance</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx48980\">CSCwx48980</a></td>\n<td>版本号待定（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Virtualized Infrastructure Manager</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx48998\">CSCwx48998</a></td>\n<td>版本号待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Routing and Switching - Enterprise and Service Provider</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Private 5G</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://bst.cloudapps.cisco.com/bugsearch/bug/CSCwx48976\">CSCwx48976</a></td>\n<td>22.23.4（待定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Unified Computing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intersight Virtual Appliance</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>版本号待定（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Cisco Cloud Hosted Services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI Canvas</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>版本号待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AppDynamics SaaS</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>版本号待定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security Cloud Control</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>20261030-b3cffcb（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intersight</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>发布编号待定（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>24.22.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webex Connect</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>6.22.2（2026 年 11 月）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">Cisco Services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI Analyzer</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td>发布编号待定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>如果某产品未在本通告中列出，Cisco 的审查表明该产品不受这些漏洞影响。</p>\n\n<p>有关这些漏洞对 Cisco 优先产品影响的调查状态信息，请参阅本通告的<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1#priority\">Cisco 优先产品状态</a>部分。</p>\n<p>Cisco 已确认此问题不影响以下 Cisco 产品：</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>终端客户端和客户端软件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Client（原 AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络与内容安全设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ISE Passive Identity Connector（ISE-PIC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Malware Analytics - Private Cloud（设备）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Network Analytics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Telemetry Broker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络管理与配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Business Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Analytics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Controller</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Portal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catalyst SD-WAN Validator</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Center Network Manager</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>License（Smart Software Manager）On-Prem</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mesh Policy Engine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nexus Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAN Insights Discovery</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ThousandEyes Enterprise Agent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ThousandEyes Enterprise Agent - Cisco Application Hosting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由与交换 - 企业和服务提供商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ultra Cloud Core - Subscriber Microservices Infrastructure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cisco Cloud Hosted Services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IoT Control Center</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Access</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Email Cloud Gateway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Email Threat Defense</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Umbrella CDaaS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WG2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cisco Services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secure Transfer Service</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meraki 设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meraki Dashboard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meraki MR 系列设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meraki MS 系列设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meraki MX 系列设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统一计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCS Software</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UCS Manager Software</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>重要提示：</strong>如果某产品未在本通告中列出，Cisco 的审查表明该产品不受此漏洞影响。</p>\n\n\n\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-4\">\n\n<p>\n                          临时缓解措施\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>任何临时缓解措施都将记录在特定产品的 Cisco bug 中，这些 bug 在本通告的<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1#vp\">受影响产品</a>部分中列出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-5\">\n<p>\n                          固定软件\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有关<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">固定软件版本</a>的信息，请查阅本通告<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1#vp\">受影响产品</a>部分中列出的 Cisco bug。</p>\n<p>在<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">考虑软件升级</a>时，建议客户定期查阅 Cisco 产品通告，这些通告可从<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">Cisco Security Advisories</a>页面获取，以确定产品是否受影响并获取完整的升级解决方案。</p>\n<p>在所有情况下，客户都应确保待升级的设备具有足够的内存，并确认当前的硬件和软件配置将在新版本发布后继续得到适当支持。如果相关信息不明确，建议客户联系 Cisco Technical Assistance Center（TAC）或其签约维护提供商。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-6\">\n<p>\n                          利用情况与公开公告\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Cisco Product Security Incident Response Team（PSIRT）已知悉有可用于本通告所述漏洞的概念验证利用代码。</p>\n<p>Cisco PSIRT 未发现任何针对 Cisco 产品的恶意利用行为。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-7\">\n<p>\n                          来源\n                          \n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>这些漏洞由 Node.js 披露。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"sec-8\">\n<p>\n        Cisco 安全漏洞政策\n        \n      </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>要了解 Cisco 安全漏洞披露政策和出版物，请参阅<a href=\"http://www.cisco.com/web/about/security/psirt/security_vulnerability_policy.html\">安全漏洞政策</a>。本文档还包含有关如何获取修复软件以及如何从 Cisco 接收安全漏洞信息的说明。</p>\n<p>有关 Cisco 漏洞管理、披露节奏和软件修补策略的更多信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/risk-based-disclosure\">Cisco 向基于风险的漏洞披露模式的转型</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tools/cns/notifications.html\">订阅</a>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-9\">\n<p>\n          \n          本公告的操作链接\n        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 67432</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 67431</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 67430</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 67429</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 301728</a></span>\n</p>\n<p><span><a>Snort Rule 301727</a></span>\n</p>\n\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"sec-10\">\n<p>\n                        URL\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u\">https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sec-11\">\n<p>\n                        修订历史\n                        \n                      </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<table>\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>版本</th>\n\t\t\t<th>说明</th>\n\t\t\t<th>章节</th>\n\t\t\t<th>状态</th>\n\t\t\t<th>日期</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.5</td>\n\t\t\t<td>更新了标题、摘要、受影响产品和已确认不受影响的产品。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>标题、摘要、受影响产品</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-NOV-04</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.4</td>\n\t\t\t<td>更新了受影响产品和已确认不受影响的产品。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>受影响产品</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-NOV-02</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.3</td>\n\t\t\t<td>更新了受影响产品和已确认不受影响的产品。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>受影响产品</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-OCT-30</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.2</td>\n\t\t\t<td>更新了受影响产品和已确认不受影响的产品。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>受影响产品</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-OCT-29</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.1</td>\n\t\t\t<td>更新了受影响产品和已确认不受影响的产品。添加了指向 Splunk 公告的链接。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>摘要和受影响产品</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-OCT-28</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>1.0</td>\n\t\t\t<td>首次公开发布。</td>\n\t\t\t<td>-</td>\n\t\t\t<td>临时</td>\n\t\t\t<td>2026-OCT-27</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><a>显示更少</a>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sec-12\">\n<p>\n                          法律免责声明\n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3 id=\"sec-13\">软件下载和技术支持</h3><p>Cisco.com 上的<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/index.html\">Cisco 支持与下载</a>页面提供了有关许可和下载的信息。对于使用 My Devices 工具的客户，此页面还可显示客户设备的支持覆盖范围。请注意，客户只能下载直接向 Cisco 或通过 Cisco 授权经销商或合作伙伴采购且许可仍然有效的软件。</p><p>直接向 Cisco 购买但未持有 Cisco 服务合同的客户，以及通过第三方供应商购买但未能通过其销售点获得修复软件的客户，应通过联系<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html\">Cisco 技术协助中心 (TAC)</a>获取升级。客户应准备好产品序列号，并准备提供本公告的 URL 作为免费升级权益的证明。</p><p>在<a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">考虑软件升级</a>时，建议客户定期查阅相关 Cisco 产品的<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">公告</a>，以确定风险暴露情况并获得完整的升级解决方案。在所有情况下，客户都应确保待升级的设备具有足够的内存，并确认当前的硬件和软件配置在新的发行版本发布后仍能继续得到适当支持。如果信息不明确，建议客户联系<a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html\">Cisco 技术协助中心 (TAC)</a>或其签约维护提供商。</p><h3 id=\"sec-14\">法律免责声明详情</h3><p>CISCO 不作出任何明示或暗示的保证或承诺，包括对适销性或特定用途适用性的保证。在不限制前述一般性声明的前提下，CISCO 不保证本信息的准确性或完整性。本文档按“现状”提供。您使用本文档或从本文档链接的材料，风险由您自行承担。CISCO 保留随时更改或更新本文档的权利。</p><p>本安全公告所含信息的副本或摘要可能缺少重要信息或包含事实错误。建议客户访问 <a href=\"https://www.cisco.com/go/psirt\">Cisco 安全公告</a> 页面，以获取本安全公告的最新版本。Cisco 产品安全事件响应团队（PSIRT）仅评估本公告中有记录的受影响版本和已修复版本信息。更多信息请参阅 <a href=\"https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/resources/security_vulnerability_policy.html#fixes\">Cisco 安全漏洞政策</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h2 id=\"sec-15\">\n<p>\n                          反馈\n                        </p>\n</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>留下更多反馈\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</tbody></table>","original","zhKind","translation","complete","漏洞","补丁","复现","漏洞分析","供应链","Cisco","Google","Node.js","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1","Cisco PSIRT",{"_137":138,"_139":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
